                                                                                
 Usage: khub get [OPTIONS] [ID]...                                              
                                                                                
 Read entities' frontmatter and body, optionally with derived edges.            
                                                                                
╭─ Arguments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│   ID...      <str>  One or more bare slugs or qualified type/slug IDs (file  │
│                     paths under --path), in output order.                    │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --edges                Include stored and derived edges.                     │
│ --path                 Read each ID as a file path, relative to the current  │
│                        directory or absolute, and get the entity in it.      │
│ --format        <str>  json, table, raw, or text (Rich on a TTY).            │
│                        [default: text]                                       │
│ --help                 Show this message and exit.                           │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

